OR TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE
OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.
]==]
TEXTS["BSD-2-Clause"] = "BSD 2-Clause License\n\nCopyright (c) YEAR, HOLDER\n\n" .. BSD_BODY .. BSD_DISCLAIMER
TEXTS["BSD-3-Clause"] = "BSD 3-Clause License\n\nCopyright (c) YEAR, HOLDER\n\n" .. BSD_BODY .. BSD3_CLAUSE .. BSD_DISCLAIMER
TEXTS["Unlicense"] = [==[This is free and unencumbered software released into the public domain.

Anyone is free to copy, modify, publish, use, compile, sell, or
distribute this software, either in source code form or as a compiled
binary, for any purpose, commercial or non-commercial, and by any
means.

In jurisdictions that recognize copyright laws, the author or authors
of this software dedicate any and all copyright interest in the
